/ 管理者ダッシュボード

/ ページヘッダー
.mb-6
  h2.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-800.dark:text-white 管理者ダッシュボード
  p.text-sm.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400.mt-2 ユーザーアクティビティとシステム統計

/ 統計サマリーカード（4つ）
.grid.grid-cols-1.md:grid-cols-2.lg:grid-cols-4.gap-6.mb-8
  / 総ユーザー数
  .bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.rounded-lg.shadow-md.p-6
    .flex.items-center.justify-between
      div
        p.text-sm.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400 総ユーザー数
        p.text-3xl.font-bold.text-blue-600.dark:text-blue-400.mt-2 = @total_users
      .w-12.h-12.bg-blue-100.dark:bg-blue-900.rounded-full.flex.items-center.justify-center
        svg.w-6.h-6.text-blue-600.dark:text-blue-400 fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"

  / 総練習回数
  .bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.rounded-lg.shadow-md.p-6
    .flex.items-center.justify-between
      div
        p.text-sm.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400 総練習回数
        p.text-3xl.font-bold.text-green-600.dark:text-green-400.mt-2 = @total_typing_sessions
      .w-12.h-12.bg-green-100.dark:bg-green-900.rounded-full.flex.items-center.justify-center
        svg.w-6.h-6.text-green-600.dark:text-green-400 fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"

  / 総キーマップ数
  .bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.rounded-lg.shadow-md.p-6
    .flex.items-center.justify-between
      div
        p.text-sm.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400 総キーマップ数
        p.text-3xl.font-bold.text-yellow-600.dark:text-yellow-400.mt-2 = @total_keymap_sets
      .w-12.h-12.bg-yellow-100.dark:bg-yellow-900.rounded-full.flex.items-center.justify-center
        svg.w-6.h-6.text-yellow-600.dark:text-yellow-400 fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01"

  / 総レッスン数
  .bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.rounded-lg.shadow-md.p-6
    .flex.items-center.justify-between
      div
        p.text-sm.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400 総レッスン数
        p.text-3xl.font-bold.text-purple-600.dark:text-purple-400.mt-2 = @total_lessons
      .w-12.h-12.bg-purple-100.dark:bg-purple-900.rounded-full.flex.items-center.justify-center
        svg.w-6.h-6.text-purple-600.dark:text-purple-400 fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"

/ レッスン統計（カテゴリー別）
.bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.rounded-lg.shadow-md.p-6.mb-8
  h3.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-800.dark:text-white.mb-4 レッスン統計（カテゴリー別）
  .grid.grid-cols-1.md:grid-cols-2.lg:grid-cols-3.gap-4
    - @lesson_categories.each do |category, lessons|
      .bg-gray-50.dark:bg-gray-700.rounded-lg.p-4
        p.text-sm.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400 = category
        p.text-2xl.font-bold.text-gray-800.dark:text-white.mt-1
          = lessons.count
          span.text-sm.font-normal.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400.ml-1 レッスン

/ ユーザー一覧テーブル（最新10名）
.bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.rounded-lg.shadow-md.p-6.mb-8
  .flex.items-center.justify-between.mb-4
    h3.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-800.dark:text-white 最近のユーザー
    = link_to admin_users_path, class: "text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline" do
      | すべて見る →

  - if @recent_users.any?
    / PC: テーブル表示
    .hidden.md:block.overflow-x-auto
      table.min-w-full.divide-y.divide-gray-200.dark:divide-gray-600
        thead.bg-gray-50.dark:bg-gray-700
          tr
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider ID
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider ユーザー
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider メールアドレス
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider 練習回数
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider 最終ログイン
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider アクション
        tbody.bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.divide-y.divide-gray-200.dark:divide-gray-600
          - @recent_users.each do |user|
            tr.hover:bg-gray-50.dark:hover:bg-gray-700
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300 = user.id
              td.px-4.py-3
                .flex.items-center
                  - if user.icon_url.present?
                    img.w-8.h-8.rounded-full.mr-3 src=user.icon_url alt=user.name
                  - else
                    .w-8.h-8.rounded-full.bg-gray-300.dark:bg-gray-600.flex.items-center.justify-center.mr-3
                      span.text-sm.font-medium.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-300 = user.name[0].upcase
                  span.text-sm.font-medium.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-200 = user.name
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300 = user.email
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300 = user.typing_sessions.count
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300
                - if user.last_sign_in_at.present?
                  = time_ago_in_words(user.last_sign_in_at)
                  | 前
                - else
                  span.text-gray-400 未ログイン
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm
                = link_to admin_user_path(user), class: "text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline" do
                  | 詳細

    / モバイル: カード表示
    .md:hidden.space-y-4
      - @recent_users.each do |user|
        .bg-gray-50.dark:bg-gray-700.rounded-lg.p-4
          .flex.items-center.mb-3
            - if user.icon_url.present?
              img.w-10.h-10.rounded-full.mr-3 src=user.icon_url alt=user.name
            - else
              .w-10.h-10.rounded-full.bg-gray-300.dark:bg-gray-600.flex.items-center.justify-center.mr-3
                span.text-base.font-medium.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-300 = user.name[0].upcase
            div
              p.font-medium.text-gray-800.dark:text-white = user.name
              p.text-xs.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400 = "ID: #{user.id}"
          .space-y-2.text-sm
            .flex.justify-between
              span.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400 メール
              span.text-gray-800.dark:text-gray-200.truncate.ml-2 = user.email
            .flex.justify-between
              span.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400 練習回数
              span.text-gray-800.dark:text-gray-200 = user.typing_sessions.count
            .flex.justify-between
              span.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400 最終ログイン
              span.text-gray-800.dark:text-gray-200
                - if user.last_sign_in_at.present?
                  = time_ago_in_words(user.last_sign_in_at)
                  | 前
                - else
                  span.text-gray-400 未ログイン
          .mt-3
            = link_to admin_user_path(user), class: "text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline text-sm" do
              | 詳細を見る →

  - else
    .text-center.py-8.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400
      p まだユーザーが登録されていません

/ 最近の練習履歴（最新10件）
.bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.rounded-lg.shadow-md.p-6
  h3.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-800.dark:text-white.mb-4 最近の練習

  - if @recent_sessions.any?
    / PC: テーブル表示
    .hidden.md:block.overflow-x-auto
      table.min-w-full.divide-y.divide-gray-200.dark:divide-gray-600
        thead.bg-gray-50.dark:bg-gray-700
          tr
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider 日時
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider ユーザー
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider レッスン
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider 単語数
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider 正答率
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider 所要時間
            th.px-4.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-300.uppercase.tracking-wider ミス数
        tbody.bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.divide-y.divide-gray-200.dark:divide-gray-600
          - @recent_sessions.each do |session|
            tr.hover:bg-gray-50.dark:hover:bg-gray-700
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300 = session.completed_at.strftime("%Y/%m/%d %H:%M")
              td.px-4.py-3
                .flex.items-center
                  - if session.user.icon_url.present?
                    img.w-8.h-8.rounded-full.mr-3 src=session.user.icon_url alt=session.user.name
                  - else
                    .w-8.h-8.rounded-full.bg-gray-300.dark:bg-gray-600.flex.items-center.justify-center.mr-3
                      span.text-sm.font-medium.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-300 = session.user.name[0].upcase
                  = link_to admin_user_path(session.user), class: "text-sm.font-medium.text-blue-600.dark:text-blue-400.hover:underline" do
                    = session.user.name
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300
                - if session.lesson_name.present?
                  = session.lesson_name
                - else
                  span.text-gray-400 不明
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300 = session.word_count
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm
                - accuracy_class = session.accuracy >= 90 ? "text-green-600 dark:text-green-400" : session.accuracy >= 70 ? "text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400" : "text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
                span class=accuracy_class = "#{session.accuracy}%"
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300
                - if session.duration_seconds.present?
                  = "#{session.duration_seconds}秒"
                - else
                  span.text-gray-400 不明
              td.px-4.py-3.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300 = session.mistake_count

    / モバイル: カード表示
    .md:hidden.space-y-4
      - @recent_sessions.each do |session|
        .bg-gray-50.dark:bg-gray-700.rounded-lg.p-4
          .flex.items-center.mb-3
            - if session.user.icon_url.present?
              img.w-10.h-10.rounded-full.mr-3 src=session.user.icon_url alt=session.user.name
            - else
              .w-10.h-10.rounded-full.bg-gray-300.dark:bg-gray-600.flex.items-center.justify-center.mr-3
                span.text-base.font-medium.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-300 = session.user.name[0].upcase
            div
              = link_to admin_user_path(session.user), class: "font-medium.text-gray-800.dark:text-white.hover:underline" do
                = session.user.name
              p.text-xs.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400.mt-1 = session.completed_at.strftime("%Y/%m/%d %H:%M")
          .mb-3
            p.text-sm.font-medium.text-gray-800.dark:text-white
              - if session.lesson_name.present?
                = session.lesson_name
              - else
                span.text-gray-400 不明
          .grid.grid-cols-2.gap-3.text-sm
            div
              p.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400.text-xs 単語数
              p.text-gray-800.dark:text-gray-200.font-medium = session.word_count
            div
              p.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400.text-xs 正答率
              - accuracy_class = session.accuracy >= 90 ? "text-green-600 dark:text-green-400" : session.accuracy >= 70 ? "text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400" : "text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
              p.font-medium class=accuracy_class = "#{session.accuracy}%"
            div
              p.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400.text-xs 所要時間
              p.text-gray-800.dark:text-gray-200.font-medium
                - if session.duration_seconds.present?
                  = "#{session.duration_seconds}秒"
                - else
                  span.text-gray-400 不明
            div
              p.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-400.text-xs ミス数
              p.text-gray-800.dark:text-gray-200.font-medium = session.mistake_count

  - else
    .text-center.py-8.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400
      p 練習履歴がまだありません
